    family's own overflow decomposition names the word. *)
Lemma gxi_1RB1RB_0LC1RB_1LA1LD_1LC0RA : forall j, Cin (fill (pow2 j)) = cden [] [] j BE0_1RB1RB_0LC1RB_1LA1LD_1LC0RA.
Proof.
