    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StA, S0)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB1RB_1RC0RC_0LD1RA_0LA1LD [SWinR 4; SCycL 3 0; SWin 4; SWinL 1] (StA, S0) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
                   p1 j1 E1).
