    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB1RC_0LA0RB_0LD1LD_1RA1LC p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB1RC_0LA0RB_0LD1LD_1RA1LC p j' E).
    + lia.
