    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StB, S1)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB1RC_0LA0RB_0LD1LD_1RA1LC [SWinR 6; SCycL 2 0; SWin 1; SWinL 3] (StB, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
